{"abstract":"Fakes have become a matter of concern across global health. Commissioning inquiry into presumed fake practices in global health requires both a pre-existing sense of what would constitute real provision and a suspicion that it is not being offered. In this Position Piece, we analyse the research methods being used to identify and reveal other—presumed—fakes in global health provision. We put forward the concept of the ‘second-order fake’—the fake that is used to reveal a fake—to draw attention to the methodological politics at stake in the use of the fake. By reviewing historical cases of the creation of methods of deception, we analyse the assumptions they bring into global health from other disciplines. We foreground the promises of revelation that are embedded in probes that rely on fakes to uncover fakes. We suggest that despite the growing prevalence of methods which themselves deploy fakes to find fakes, these techniques bring us no closer to understanding the lived ambiguities of everyday practices of fakery.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Kingori, Patricia","Douglas-Jones, Rachel"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-381837"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Oxford"],"keyword":["Deception","Fake","Global Health","Method","Probes"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"revelation or confirmation the fake probe in global health","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.17157/mat.7.2.776","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-381837","ids":["itu-25e1798b-219a-466b-b835-311e6734ae17"],"keyword":["Deception","Fake","Global health","Method","Probes"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-968D089FFDEBCF2822913C72379D78F5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/85683015/Revelation_or_confirmation.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.17157/mat.7.2.776","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"gb","key":"university of oxford","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Oxford","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Patricia","key":"kingoripau","last":"Kingori","name":"Kingori, Patricia","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rachel","key":"douglasjonespau","last":"Douglas-Jones","locid":"f11b0cc1-ad9f-4b12-b805-65b70e5bcd65","name":"Douglas-Jones, Rachel","orcid":"0000-0001-9562-6572","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.17157/mat.7.2.776","issn":["2405691X"],"issue":"2","journal":"MAT Medicine Anthropology Theory","pages":"214-229","publisher":"University of Amsterdam","status":"p","title":"MAT Medicine Anthropology Theory","title_org":"Medicine Anthropology Theory","volume":"7"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-25e1798b-219a-466b-b835-311e6734ae17"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Revelation or confirmation? The ‘fake probe’ in global health","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-381837","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"On the eve of the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) coming into effect we, a university laboratory, marked the occasion with an interactive installation called Compliance. Data traces from Compliance were subsequently processed by the lab, here enacted in the form of a play. While much discussion has centered around modern 'black-boxed' processing of data, less attention has been paid to the value of the data itself, and whether it merits use. We draw on dramaturgical methods for both analysis and presentation [15], allowing for readers to imagine staging their own, different, versions of the event. Drawing on the ambiguous ontological status of (yet unexamined) data, we offer a discussion on the value of data, its use and non-use, as well as how to live with this ambivalence, continuously negotiating social contracts about our further conduct with the data.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Gahoonia, Simy Kaur","Ferreira, Pedro","Cohn, Marisa","Henriksen, Line","Kjær, Katrine Meldgaard","Hockenhull, Michael","Cakici, Baki","Blønd, Marie","Douglas-Jones, Rachel","Laursen, Cæcilie Sloth","Zell, Sonja"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384849"],"event":{"acronym":"CHI","title":"ACM Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["GDPR","data non use","dramaturgical methods"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"upon not opening the black box","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85090243080","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384849","identifier":[{"id":"85090243080","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-f39b7fd5-7493-4bf3-a0f8-14dc03ecc282"],"keyword":["GDPR","data non-use","dramaturgical methods"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-276723FEC91BFD0CA307B03D82CF6C55"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Simy Kaur","key":"gahooniapau","last":"Gahoonia","locid":"6c543b1d-8137-489d-b444-d17921fc9de9","name":"Gahoonia, Simy Kaur","orcid":"0000-0001-9668-6868","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pedro","key":"ferreirapau","last":"Ferreira","locid":"1b3cff7f-1549-4998-b52e-0ba9093e1d01","name":"Ferreira, Pedro","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marisa","key":"cohnpau","last":"Cohn","locid":"e9d14210-bc71-4824-b7cf-fd1448d022ab","name":"Cohn, Marisa","orcid":"0000-0002-3912-2166","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Line","key":"henriksenpau","last":"Henriksen","name":"Henriksen, Line","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Katrine Meldgaard","key":"kjærpau","last":"Kjær","locid":"0c46864b-a7f8-4439-aeda-0781f77bfe88","name":"Kjær, Katrine Meldgaard","orcid":"0000-0001-7994-5186","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael","key":"hockenhullpau","last":"Hockenhull","locid":"5041f387-908f-4845-9f79-3a6dbd527f4b","name":"Hockenhull, Michael","orcid":"0000-0002-2670-2102","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Baki","key":"cakicipau","last":"Cakici","locid":"b614ac6f-eefa-44a3-8b9a-092b88d86d37","name":"Cakici, Baki","orcid":"0000-0002-1039-8177","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","